    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33465" root="فرز" body-key="f">
    
      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فرّز عَلَىَّ بِرَأْيِهِ</span></b> , (K,) or ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَرَزَ</span></b> , (thus, without
teshdeed, in the O,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَفْرِزَةٌ</span>, [which may be
of either of the verbs,] (K,) <i>He decided</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَطَعَ</span>)
<i>against me by his opinion.</i> (Ibn-'Abbád, O, K.
[See also 8.])

